# NOTE: docs/source/api/ (sphinx-apidoc stubs) and docs/source/tutorial_pyweatherfiles.ipynb
# are auto-regenerated on every docs build (see dist_build_docs.bat / docs/source/conf.py),
# but they ARE intentionally committed as a GitHub backup in case the Read the Docs build
# or local toolchain is ever unavailable. examples/tutorial_pyweatherfiles.ipynb remains the
# single source of truth for the notebook; the copy under docs/source/ must stay in sync with
# it (re-run dist_build_docs.bat, or copy it manually, before committing changes to either).

